#: ../../troubleshooting.md:1
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr ""
"排查"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:3
msgid "What each symptom means, and what to do about it."
msgstr ""
"每个现象意味着什么，以及该怎么处理。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:5
msgid "It will not start"
msgstr ""
"启动不起来"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:7
msgid ""
"**`missing config: provider.url, provider.key, provider.model`** — the "
"active provider entry is incomplete. Open `~/.minacode/config.toml` and "
"fill in the three required keys, or run `minacode --init-config` to write"
" a fresh starter file. `/config` shows which entry is active."
msgstr ""
"**`missing config: provider.url, provider.key, provider.model`** —— 当前激活的 "
"provider 条目不完整。打开 `~/.minacode/config.toml` 补上这三个必填键，或运行 "
"`minacode --init-config` 写一份新的起始配置。`/config` 会显示当前激活的是哪个条"
"目。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:11
msgid ""
"**Requests fail with an authentication error** — the key is wrong for the"
" url, or the entry belongs to a different vendor than the model name "
"suggests. Check that `url`, `key`, and `model` in the active entry come "
"from the same provider."
msgstr ""
"**请求返回鉴权错误** —— key 与 url 不匹配，或者这个条目其实属于另一家厂商，而不是模"
"型名看起来的那家。确认激活条目里的 `url`、`key`、`model` 来自同一个服务商。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:15
msgid ""
"**`compaction provider ... is missing key, model`** — the `[compaction]` "
"entry is incomplete. That entry needs its own url, key, and model, "
"exactly like a provider you converse with. See [Compaction "
"model](configuration.md#compaction-model)."
msgstr ""
"**`compaction provider ... is missing key, model`** —— `[compaction]` 条目不完整。"
"这个条目也需要自己的 url、key 和 model，和你直接对话的 provider 一样。见"
"[压缩模型](configuration.md#compaction-model)。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:19
msgid "The model call fails"
msgstr ""
"模型调用失败"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:21
msgid ""
"**It failed instantly instead of retrying.** Rate limits, timeouts, and "
"server errors are retried automatically, with the attempt shown as "
"`retrying 2/6` on the divider. Two kinds of failure never retry, because "
"a second attempt would fail the same way: <span class=\"marker\">quota "
"and billing errors</span> — an exhausted balance, an expired plan — and a"
" response that hit the model's output cap. Read the error text: it comes "
"from your provider and names the account problem."
msgstr ""
"**它没有重试，直接就失败了。** 限流、超时和服务端错误会自动重试，重试次数会以 "
"`retrying 2/6` 显示在分隔线上。有两类失败从不重试，因为再试一次结果一样：<span class=\"marker\">额度与账单错误</span>——余额耗尽、套餐过期——以及触到模型输出上限的"
"响应。看错误正文：它来自你的 provider，会指出账号上的问题。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:28
msgid ""
"**`Model response exceeded provider.response_timeout=600s`** — one "
"response took longer than the total-generation limit. Raise "
"`response_timeout` for that provider entry, or set it to `0` to wait "
"indefinitely. See [Optional provider settings](configuration.md#optional-"
"provider-settings)."
msgstr ""
"**`Model response exceeded provider.response_timeout=600s`** —— 一次响应超过了总生"
"成时限。调大该 provider 条目的 `response_timeout`，或设为 `0` 表示无限等待。见"
"[可选的 provider 设置](configuration.md#optional-provider-settings)。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:32
msgid ""
"**The reply mentions a model or parameter the provider does not know.** "
"Set `api` explicitly on that entry rather than leaving it to be detected,"
" and check the model name against the provider's own list. `/config` "
"shows the protocol and reasoning effort actually in use."
msgstr ""
"**回复里出现了 provider 不认识的模型或参数。** 给该条目显式设置 `api`，不要交给自动"
"识别，并对照 provider 自己的列表核对模型名。`/config` 会显示实际生效的协议与推理强"
"度。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:36
msgid "Context and summaries"
msgstr ""
"上下文与摘要"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:38
msgid ""
"**The context was trimmed but no summary appeared.** The summary request "
"failed and minacode made room anyway. `/compact log` marks that pass `no "
"summary`. See [When a summary does not arrive](context.md#when-a-summary-"
"does-not-arrive)."
msgstr ""
"**上下文被裁剪了，但没有出现摘要。** 摘要请求失败了，minacode 仍然腾出了空间。"
"`/compact log` 会把那次压缩标记为 `no summary`。见"
"[摘要没有拿到时](context.md#when-a-summary-does-not-arrive)。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:42
msgid ""
"**`context is over budget and nothing is left to compact`** — the latest "
"exchange alone exceeds the window, so there is nothing older to "
"summarize. It is usually one enormous tool result. Start a fresh session "
"for the next task, or raise `runtime.max_context_tokens` if the model's "
"window allows."
msgstr ""
"**`context is over budget and nothing is left to compact`** —— 仅最近这一次交互就已"
"经超出窗口，没有更早的内容可以摘要了。通常是某个特别大的工具结果。为下一个任务开一"
"个新会话，或者在模型窗口允许时调大 `runtime.max_context_tokens`。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:47
msgid ""
"**`/compact` says there is nothing to compact.** Everything left is "
"recent enough that compaction may not drop it. Nothing is wrong — the "
"context is already as small as it gets."
msgstr ""
"**`/compact` 说没有可压缩的内容。** 剩下的都足够新，压缩不允许丢弃它们。这不是故"
"障——上下文已经小到不能再小了。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:50
msgid "Cache and cost"
msgstr ""
"缓存与花费"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:52
msgid ""
"**The cache ratio sits near zero.** A provider reuses a request only up "
"to its first difference, so anything that changes the beginning of a "
"request — switching models, connecting an MCP server, installing a skill "
"— starts a fresh prefix. It recovers over the following turns if you "
"leave those alone. Not every provider caches, and each reports it "
"differently; see [Prompt caching](context.md#prompt-caching)."
msgstr ""
"**缓存命中率一直接近零。** provider 只会复用请求中第一处差异之前的部分，所以任何改"
"变请求开头的动作——切换模型、连接 MCP 服务器、安装 skill——都会让前缀重新开始。只要"
"不再动它们，接下来的几个回合就会恢复。并非所有 provider 都做缓存，各家的统计口径也"
"不同；见[提示词缓存](context.md#prompt-caching)。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:58
msgid ""
"**Tokens are climbing faster than expected.** `/status` breaks the "
"session into conversation and summary usage. [Spending less](context.md"
"#spending-less) lists what each lever does."
msgstr ""
"**token 涨得比预期快。** `/status` 会把会话拆成对话用量和摘要用量两行。"
"[更省钱](context.md#spending-less)列出了每个杠杆的作用。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:61
msgid "Editing and tools"
msgstr ""
"编辑与工具"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:63
msgid ""
"**`stale anchor ...`** — the file changed after the agent read it, so the"
" edit was refused rather than applied to the wrong lines. This is the "
"guardrail working. Ask the agent to re-read the file and try again."
msgstr ""
"**`stale anchor ...`** —— 文件在 agent 读过之后发生了变化，因此这次编辑被拒绝，而不"
"是落到错误的行上。这是防护在起作用。让 agent 重新读一次文件再试。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:67
msgid ""
"**A tool asks for confirmation every time.** That is the default for "
"anything that writes files or runs commands. `/yolo` turns confirmations "
"off for the session; read [Safety](safety.md) first."
msgstr ""
"**每次都要确认某个工具。** 凡是写文件或执行命令的操作，默认都要确认。`/yolo` 可以在"
"本次会话关闭确认；先读一读[安全](safety.md)。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:70
msgid ""
"**The code index says `stale` or `?`.** Run `/index` to rebuild it. "
"Search and navigation still work without it — they fall back to scanning "
"— but symbol lookups are slower and less precise."
msgstr ""
"**代码索引显示 `stale` 或 `?`。** 运行 `/index` 重建。没有索引搜索和导航依然可"
"用——它们会退回到扫描——只是符号查找更慢、更不精确。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:73
msgid "Sessions"
msgstr ""
"会话"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:75
msgid ""
"**`Session snapshot not found`** — the id does not exist under this data "
"directory, or it was swept. Run `/sessions all` to list everything saved,"
" across projects."
msgstr ""
"**`Session snapshot not found`** —— 这个 id 在当前数据目录下不存在，或者已经被清"
"理。运行 `/sessions all` 可以列出所有项目里保存的全部会话。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:78
msgid ""
"**A session I expected is gone.** Sessions untouched for seven days are "
"removed at startup. Resuming one resets its clock; "
"`runtime.session_retention_days = 0` keeps them indefinitely. See "
"[Sessions](usage.md#sessions)."
msgstr ""
"**我以为还在的会话不见了。** 七天没有动过的会话会在启动时被清理。恢复一个会话会重"
"置它的计时；`runtime.session_retention_days = 0` 则永久保留。见"
"[会话](usage.md#sessions)。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:82
msgid ""
"**Resuming shows blanks where I expect details.** A session started "
"before a feature existed has nothing recorded for it. See [Sessions "
"started before these features](context.md#sessions-started-before-these-"
"features)."
msgstr ""
"**恢复后本该有细节的地方是空的。** 在某项功能存在之前开始的会话，没有为它记录任何"
"东西。见[在这些功能之前开始的会话](context.md#sessions-started-before-these-features)。"

#: ../../troubleshooting.md:86
msgid ""
"**`/sessions` refuses to switch.** Switching mid-turn would abandon a "
"request already in flight. Press `Ctrl-C` first, then run it again."
msgstr ""
"**`/sessions` 不肯切换。** 在回合进行中切换会丢弃一个已经发出的请求。先按 "
"`Ctrl-C`，再运行一次。"

